# the host's load model (host.c load_model) against the FM-1, as tools/preset_prof.py measured it (written by
# preset_prof.py --scenario from preset_prof.csv): each preset on T2 of a new project, its chord held
# (preset_prof.py CHORD), the model's mean within 6 points of the FM-1's. The guard sees no load here (load
# 0): the model alone.
wait 300
load 0
# knit (knit): x1 18 / x4 23 / x8 26
preset 2 knit knit
wait 50
play 2 48 on 100
wait 300
meter 1500
expect voices 1
expect model_avg >11
expect model_avg <24
play 2 48 off
wait 2500
play 2 48 on 100
play 2 55 on 100
play 2 60 on 100
play 2 64 on 100
wait 300
meter 1500
expect voices 4
expect model_avg >16
expect model_avg <29
play 2 48 off
play 2 55 off
play 2 60 off
play 2 64 off
wait 2500
play 2 48 on 100
play 2 55 on 100
play 2 60 on 100
play 2 64 on 100
play 2 67 on 100
play 2 72 on 100
play 2 76 on 100
play 2 79 on 100
wait 300
meter 1500
expect voices 6
expect model_avg >19
expect model_avg <32
play 2 48 off
play 2 55 off
play 2 60 off
play 2 64 off
play 2 67 off
play 2 72 off
play 2 76 off
play 2 79 off
wait 2500
